{"seq":3,"slug":"distillation-guidance","title":"引导蒸馏","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/diffusion-sampling-solvers/acceleration/distillation-guidance","wordCount":1785,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"引导蒸馏\">引导蒸馏</h1><p>无分类器引导（CFG）是文生图画质的命脉，但它有个昂贵的代价：每一步采样要把网络跑<strong>两次</strong>——一次有条件、一次无条件——再做差。换句话说，开了 CFG，你的有效 NFE 直接翻倍。当步数蒸馏和一致性模型已经把步数压到个位数时，这「翻倍」就成了下一个要啃的硬骨头。引导蒸馏的目标，就是把 CFG 的效果<strong>烤进</strong>模型权重，让每步只跑一次网络也能享受引导的画质。这一篇讲清它的动机、做法和与少步蒸馏的叠加。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-把两次前向压成一次\">核心概念：把两次前向压成一次</h2><p>先回顾 CFG 的运行时机制（完整版见 <a href=\"../practice/guidance-cfg\">无分类器引导 CFG</a>）。每步的引导噪声估计是：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>ϵ</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>ϵ</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∅</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>w</mi><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">(</mo><msub><mi>ϵ</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>c</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>ϵ</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∅</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tilde{\\epsilon} = \\epsilon_\\theta(x_t, \\varnothing) + w\\big(\\epsilon_\\theta(x_t, c) - \\epsilon_\\theta(x_t, \\varnothing)\\big)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6679em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6679em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϵ</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.35em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1944em;\"><span class=\"mord\">~</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϵ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord amsrm\">∅</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϵ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϵ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord amsrm\">∅</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span> 是条件（提示词）、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∅</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\varnothing</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6633em;vertical-align:-0.0817em;\"></span><span class=\"mord amsrm\">∅</span></span></span></span></span> 是空条件、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>w</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span></span> 是引导强度。要算这个，必须分别求 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>ϵ</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>c</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\epsilon_\\theta(x_t, c)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϵ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>ϵ</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∅</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\epsilon_\\theta(x_t, \\varnothing)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϵ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord amsrm\">∅</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 两次前向。</p>\n<p>引导蒸馏（Guidance Distillation，Meng 等 2023 年提出）的做法是：训练一个<strong>学生网络</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>ϵ</mi><mi>θ</mi><mtext>student</mtext></msubsup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>c</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>w</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\epsilon_\\theta^{\\text{student}}(x_t, c, w)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1322em;vertical-align:-0.2831em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϵ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4169em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">student</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2831em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，它把引导强度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>w</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span></span> 当作一个额外输入条件，直接学会输出上式右端的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>ϵ</mi><mo>~</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tilde\\epsilon</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6679em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6679em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϵ</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.35em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1944em;\"><span class=\"mord\">~</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。训练时让学生匹配老师在各种 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>w</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span></span> 下的引导输出。蒸成之后，推理每步只调一次学生网络，就拿到了带引导的估计——NFE 直接砍半。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[&quot;原始 CFG 每步&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;前向 1:有条件 ε(x,c)&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; C[&quot;前向 2:无条件 ε(x,∅)&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; D[&quot;组合 ε + w·(ε_c - ε_∅)&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; D&#10;    D --&gt; E[&quot;有效 NFE = 2 × 步数&quot;]&#10;    F[&quot;引导蒸馏后&quot;] --&gt; G[&quot;学生 ε(x, c, w)&lt;br/&gt;w 作为输入条件&quot;]&#10;    G --&gt; H[&quot;单次前向直接输出引导结果&quot;]&#10;    H --&gt; I[&quot;有效 NFE = 1 × 步数&quot;]\">graph TD\n    A[\"原始 CFG 每步\"] --&gt; B[\"前向 1:有条件 ε(x,c)\"]\n    A --&gt; C[\"前向 2:无条件 ε(x,∅)\"]\n    B --&gt; D[\"组合 ε + w·(ε_c - ε_∅)\"]\n    C --&gt; D\n    D --&gt; E[\"有效 NFE = 2 × 步数\"]\n    F[\"引导蒸馏后\"] --&gt; G[\"学生 ε(x, c, w)&lt;br/&gt;w 作为输入条件\"]\n    G --&gt; H[\"单次前向直接输出引导结果\"]\n    H --&gt; I[\"有效 NFE = 1 × 步数\"]</pre><h2 id=\"为什么它对少步模型几乎是必需\">为什么它对少步模型几乎是必需</h2><p>引导蒸馏在多步模型上是「锦上添花」（省一半算力），但到了少步蒸馏模型那里，它近乎<strong>必需</strong>，原因有二。</p>\n<p><strong>其一，算力比例放大。</strong> 多步模型里 CFG 翻倍是「20→40 步」，少步模型里是「4→8 步」——后者的相对开销同样是 2 倍，但在追求极致低延迟（实时、边缘）的少步场景，省掉这一半是上线与否的差别。<strong>其二，少步与 CFG 的数值冲突。</strong> 如 <a href=\"consistency-models\">一致性模型</a> 末尾指出，少步蒸馏模型对外部 CFG 的响应被重塑，直接套高 CFG 会过曝崩坏。于是主流做法是在蒸馏阶段就把引导<strong>一并烤进</strong>学生——LCM、DMD2、SDXL-Turbo 这些模型的蒸馏流程，几乎都内置了引导蒸馏，使得用户调的「CFG」要么是被重新校准过的小范围值、要么干脆固定。</p>\n<p>下表对比三种处理引导的方式：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方式</th>\n<th>每步前向次数</th>\n<th>引导可调性</th>\n<th>典型场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>运行时 CFG</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>自由调 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>w</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>多步训练无关采样</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>引导蒸馏（独立）</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>w</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span></span> 作输入仍可调</td>\n<td>多步模型省算力</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>引导内化进少步蒸馏</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>固定或小范围</td>\n<td>LCM/Turbo/DMD2 等少步模型</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"与少步蒸馏的叠加关系\">与少步蒸馏的叠加关系</h2><p>引导蒸馏与 <a href=\"step-distillation\">步数蒸馏</a>、一致性蒸馏是<strong>正交</strong>的两件事，可以叠加：前者压「每步的前向次数」，后者压「步数」。理论上 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>有效 NFE</mtext><mo>=</mo><mtext>步数</mtext><mo>×</mo><mtext>每步前向数</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{有效 NFE} = \\text{步数} \\times \\text{每步前向数}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">有效</span><span class=\"mord\"> NFE</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">步数</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">每步前向数</span></span></span></span></span></span>，两个因子各砍一半，乘起来就是四分之一。</p>\n<p>实际中，2024 年后的少步蒸馏方法大多把两者<strong>合并到一次训练</strong>里完成，而非分两阶段。比如 SDXL-Turbo 的 ADD、DMD2，都在蒸馏少步学生的同时让它直接输出已含引导的结果，所以用户拿到的就是「4 步、单前向、画质够用」的成品。这种「步数 + 引导一锅蒸」的配方，是 2026 年商用少步模型的标准形态。代价是灵活性：你失去了运行时自由调引导强度的能力，换来了极致的速度。</p>\n<h2 id=\"蒸馏的引导-藏在哪里\">蒸馏的引导，藏在哪里</h2><p>用户经常困惑：FLUX.1-dev 明明能调一个叫「guidance」的值，可它又号称蒸馏过引导，这两者怎么共存？答案揭示了引导蒸馏的一个微妙形态——<strong>蒸馏不一定锁死引导，可以把引导强度保留为一个输入维度</strong>。</p>\n<p>回到核心公式里的设计：学生网络 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>ϵ</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>c</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>w</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\epsilon_\\theta(x_t, c, w)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϵ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>w</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span></span> 当输入。如果蒸馏时喂入各种 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>w</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span></span> 让学生都学会，那推理时用户仍能调 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>w</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span></span>，只是每步仍只算一次前向——这就是 FLUX.1-dev 的「distilled guidance」：引导被蒸成一个可调旋钮，省了一半算力，又没牺牲可调性。而 FLUX.1-schnell（更激进的少步版）则把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>w</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span></span> 也固定了，换取极致速度，所以它根本不暴露 guidance 旋钮。</p>\n<p>这条区别很实用：看到一个模型暴露「guidance」而非「CFG」，通常意味着它做了引导蒸馏（单前向、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>w</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span></span> 可调），调法和传统 CFG 不同、范围也不同（FLUX-dev 常用 3.5 左右）；看到一个少步模型完全不让调引导，说明 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>w</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span></span> 被一并蒸死了。能从「暴不暴露引导旋钮、叫 CFG 还是 guidance」反推模型的蒸馏形态，是少步时代一项很值钱的直觉。</p>\n<h2 id=\"实践提示与边界\">实践提示与边界</h2><p>用引导蒸馏或引导内化模型时，记住几条。<strong>第一，别叠加外部 CFG。</strong> 模型已内化引导，再在采样器里开高 CFG 等于引导两次，必崩；这类模型的推荐 CFG 通常是 1（关闭）或一个很小的值，具体看模型卡（详见 <a href=\"../practice/sampler-tuning\">采样调参</a>）。<strong>第二，引导强度不可调是真实损失。</strong> 有些创作流程依赖动态调 CFG 控制「贴合提示 vs 多样性」，内化引导后这条路堵了；若你需要这种控制，宁可用未蒸馏模型 + 运行时 CFG。<strong>第三，质量上限受蒸馏时选定的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>w</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span></span> 影响。</strong> 蒸馏固定了引导的「口味」，若它选的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>w</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span></span> 偏高，所有产出都会带那种高引导的浓烈风格，无法回退。</p>\n<p>所以引导蒸馏不是纯粹的免费加速，而是一次「用灵活性换速度」的工程取舍——和整个加速章的主题一致。理解它，你就能解释为什么 Turbo/Lightning/LCM 这些模型「不用调 CFG」「调了反而坏」，这是少步时代最常见的困惑之一。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>CFG 每步要跑有条件、无条件两次前向，开引导即有效 NFE 翻倍；引导蒸馏把引导效果烤进权重，每步只跑一次。</li>\n<li>做法是训练学生网络把引导强度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>w</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span></span> 当输入条件，直接输出组合后的引导估计。</li>\n<li>对少步模型近乎必需：算力比例同样翻倍，且少步与外部高 CFG 数值冲突，故多在蒸馏时内化引导。</li>\n<li>与步数蒸馏正交可叠加，有效 NFE = 步数 × 每步前向数；2024 年后多合并为「一锅蒸」。</li>\n<li>代价是失去运行时调引导的灵活性，并被蒸馏时选定的引导口味锁定——典型的速度换灵活性取舍。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>它压缩的那个运行时机制全貌：<a href=\"../practice/guidance-cfg\">无分类器引导 CFG</a></li>\n<li>与之叠加的步数压缩路线：<a href=\"step-distillation\">步数蒸馏</a></li>\n<li>为何少步模型要配低 CFG：<a href=\"consistency-models\">一致性模型</a></li>\n<li>跨库：条件与引导在模型架构层的实现见 <a href=\"../../generative-ai/diffusion-models/conditioning-guidance\">生成式 AI · 条件与引导</a></li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"引导蒸馏","id":"引导蒸馏"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：把两次前向压成一次","id":"核心概念-把两次前向压成一次"},{"level":2,"text":"为什么它对少步模型几乎是必需","id":"为什么它对少步模型几乎是必需"},{"level":2,"text":"与少步蒸馏的叠加关系","id":"与少步蒸馏的叠加关系"},{"level":2,"text":"蒸馏的引导，藏在哪里","id":"蒸馏的引导-藏在哪里"},{"level":2,"text":"实践提示与边界","id":"实践提示与边界"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"一致性模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/diffusion-sampling-solvers/acceleration/consistency-models"},"next":{"title":"无分类器引导 CFG","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/diffusion-sampling-solvers/practice/guidance-cfg"}}